         SLO,SFS,SLO,DSQ,QLO)

ARC: line=(BEArcMain,78*ArcMain,BEArcMain)

!/ Straight Section Elements
qfsh0: quadrupole, l = 0.235, k1 = kqfstr, aperture_type = elliptical, aperture = 18.16e-3, r0_mag = 15.e-3
